title: The Informer
subtitle: A police spy in a district committee.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('informer'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('informer');
Q.lw_name = RG.pick(['the district treasurer', 'the chairman of the youth group', 'the comrade who runs the duplicating machine', 'a member of the district committee', 'the head of the district\'s red guard']);
!}

= The Informer

For months the police in **[+ lw_d_name +]** have known the date of every meeting and where every leaflet was printed. Now a comrade who cleans the police headquarters in [+ lw_town +] has seen a receipt for forty marks a month, signed by [+ lw_name +]. He has been in the party since 1918, and he does not yet know that we know.

- @expose: Print his photograph and the receipt.
- @feed: Leave him in place and feed him false information.
- @guards: Hand him over to the red guard.

@expose
subtitle: The police lose their eyes in the district, for a while.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -8});
RG.news('Police informer unmasked in the ' + Q.lw_d_name + ' party');
!}

The headline in [+ lw_paper +] is "Forty marks a month". He leaves the city within a week.

@feed
subtitle: The police chase shadows. If he notices, the next raid will be a big one.
on-arrival: {!
if (Math.random() < 0.7) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -15});
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: 10, members: -0.03});
}
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : For three months the police raid empty cellars and stake out meetings that never take place. Then they stop believing him. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : He notices that he is being told different things from everyone else, and goes straight to his handler. ?]

@guards
subtitle: The guard has its own way with traitors. If it goes too far, the party pays for it in court.
view-if: offensive_gone = 0 or ultraleft_gone = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.red_guards_loyalty += 4;
if (Math.random() < 0.35) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: 12, members: -0.03});
    Q.worker_support -= 3;
    RG.news('Body of a police informer found in the canal at ' + Q.lw_town, 2);
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -6});
}
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : He is found in the canal a week later. The police arrest six men of the guard, and the nationalist press writes about the Cheka in [+ lw_town +]. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : The guard gives him a beating in a garden shed and a ticket for the night train. He takes it. ?]
